      "body": [
        {
          "type": "TextualBody",
          "label": "Folio 2v (eighth section of join)",
          "value": "\n<ol><li>\n<p>and recited the secret holy Name and flew up after him. When</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>When Yeshu saw him, he entered and hid in the cave of Elijah, peace be upon him,</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>and shut the mouth of the cave with a gate of magic.&nbsp;Yehudah the gardener came and opened&nbsp;</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>the cave&rsquo;s gate by the Name of God the Exalted, the Majestic. And Yeshu disguised himself as a bird, and Yehudah took</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>his headscarf and threw it on him. And they caught him and arrested him and he was brought to Yehoshu\u02bfa</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>ben Perah\u0323iah. And they raised him up, and they crucified him on a root of a cabbage.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>But before they crucified him, he had known that it is written</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>in the Torah &ldquo;Do not let his corpse remain overnight on the tree,&rdquo; and he said to his followers: &ldquo;If you come tomorrow&nbsp;</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>here on the cross&mdash;then know that I ascended to</p>\n</li>\n<li>Heaven.&rdquo; Then they crucified him alive, and stoned him with stones. And they did not&nbsp;</li>\n<li>\n<p>want to take&nbsp;him down from the cross.&nbsp;Yehoshu\u02bfa ben Perah\u0323iah said to them:&nbsp;</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>&ldquo;Because of the cursed Yeshu we shall change what is (written) in the Torah?&rdquo;&nbsp;</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>They brought him down and buri[ed him] in the water-trough in the garden of Yehudah the gardener. When</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>his followers came to him, and did not find him on the cross, they calumniated and said that &ldquo;He ascended</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>to Heaven and his words that he said are true and your words are false.&rdquo;</p>\n</li></ol>\n",
          "format": "text/html"
        }
      ],
